{"abstract":"In this paper we propose Experimental Engineering as a way to articulate open- ended technological experiments as a legitimate design research practice. Experimental Engineering introduces a move away from an outcome or result driven design process towards an interest in existing technologies and how they can assist in creating completely new understandings of people, technology, and their interactions.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Vallgårda, Anna","Grönvall, Erik","Fritsch, Jonas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382895"],"event":{"acronym":"DIS","title":"ACM Conference on Designing Interactive Systems"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Bricolage","Design Research Practice","Experimental Engineering","explorations","material strategy"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"experimental engineering articulating and valuing design experimentation","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/82388387/Experimental_Engineering_CameraReady_reduced_ITUversion.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-382895","identifier":[{"id":"85022204569","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-6d007e4b-3736-4231-9504-a850d4582ab0"],"keyword":["Experimental Engineering","bricolage","design research practice","explorations","material strategy."],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-BA3C14771AB84DC21D570576F931C15B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/82388387/Experimental_Engineering_CameraReady_reduced_ITUversion.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anna","key":"vallgårdapau","last":"Vallgårda","locid":"2fa5dc89-7d78-45d0-96c7-e8f39b78dd3e","name":"Vallgårda, Anna","orcid":"0000-0001-9898-8106","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Erik","key":"grönvallpau","last":"Grönvall","locid":"1e0534b4-fe3e-4c5e-ad6d-5f1c7df6a14e","name":"Grönvall, Erik","orcid":"0000-0002-7377-6091","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jonas","key":"fritschpau","last":"Fritsch","locid":"d37cba38-dff2-4c27-a515-226cfadfd849","name":"Fritsch, Jonas","orcid":"0000-0001-9065-2843","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3064857.3079145","eisbn":["9781450349918"],"pages":"197-201","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 2017 ACM Conference Companion Publication on Designing Interactive Systems"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85022204569"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-6d007e4b-3736-4231-9504-a850d4582ab0"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Experimental Engineering: Articulating and Valuing Design Experimentation","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-382895","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"In this paper, we present the preliminary results from an ongoing interaction design experiment, the Voice Pump. The Voice Pump is an affectively engaging air-based interface for attuning to the differential qualities of voices in order to change attachments between native Danish speakers and non-native Danish speakers, in particular refugees coming to the country. We present the outset for the design process, the current version of the design, the technical setup for the air-based sound processing and how we plan to continue our explorations in the future.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Fritsch, Jonas","Jacobsen, Mogens"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-381351"],"event":{"acronym":"DIS","title":"ACM Conference on Designing Interactive Systems"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Affective Computing","Air based Interface","Cross cultural Communication","Interaction design","Voice Attunement"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the voice pump an affectively engaging interface for changing attachments","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/82486260/DIS17_WIP_The_Voice_Pump_FINAL_DRAFT_CAMERA_READY_.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-381351","identifier":[{"id":"85022210831","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-0637a1d6-73ea-4ed6-85ca-b93e4a579af0"],"keyword":["Affective Computing","Air-based Interface","Cross-cultural Communication","Interaction Design","Voice Attunement"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-E836C55E655426CD9EA0312547853D00"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/82486260/DIS17_WIP_The_Voice_Pump_FINAL_DRAFT_CAMERA_READY_.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design","IT University of Copenhagen, Human-Computer Interaction and Design, Affective Interactions & Relations Lab","IT University of Copenhagen, Play, Culture, and AI, Media, Art & Design"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jonas","key":"fritschpau","last":"Fritsch","locid":"d37cba38-dff2-4c27-a515-226cfadfd849","name":"Fritsch, Jonas","orcid":"0000-0001-9065-2843","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mogens","key":"jacobsenpau","last":"Jacobsen","name":"Jacobsen, Mogens","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3064857.3079158","eisbn":["9781450349918"],"pages":"265-269","place":"Edinburgh","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 2017 ACM Conference Companion Publication on Designing Interactive Systems"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85022210831"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-0637a1d6-73ea-4ed6-85ca-b93e4a579af0"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"The Voice Pump: an Affectively Engaging Interface for Changing Attachments","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-381351","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
