{"abstract":"We explore design argumentation as a resource when teaching interaction design in a university setting. We propose that design argumentation can help bridge between practice-based design education and theoretical issues from university curricula. In this paper, we outline the idea of design argumentation and report on initial experiences from interaction design teaching activities. We discuss how this approach allows students to build up a shared and rigorous design vocabulary in order to formulate valid claims when arguing for and through their design work based on empirical, theoretical and material grounds.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Dalsgaard, Peter","Dindler, Christian","Fritsch, Jonas"],"cuid":["S02-091.67-031049"],"event":{"end":"2013-06-12","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2013-06-09","title":"Nordes 2013","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Design Argumentation","Design Vocabulary","Design education","Interaction design","University teaching"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"design argumentation in academic design education","src":["au","itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://nordes.org/nordes2013/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-091.67-031049","ids":["au-fffab53f-e8f0-484b-bb79-e20d9bdd938d","itu-ffd66830-92b7-46c2-aff2-2a7851120bb2"],"keyword":["Design Argumentation","Design Education","Design Vocabulary","Interaction Design","University Teaching"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-2-F1B4567AE249929372A1196B80D36E89"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://nordes.org/nordes2013/","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, School of Communication and Culture, School of Communication and Culture - Information Science","Aarhus University, Arts, School of Communication and Culture, School of Communication and Culture - Participatory Information Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter","key":"dalsgaardpau","last":"Dalsgaard","locid":"07bc29a5-f5da-47d0-8290-fd9ab3659541","name":"Dalsgaard, Peter","orcid":"0000-0001-9884-7178","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Christian","key":"dindlerpau","last":"Dindler","locid":"a72cbe3d-cba3-4a68-a336-b496a7a22866","name":"Dindler, Christian","orcid":"0000-0002-4914-3323","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jonas","key":"fritschpau","last":"Fritsch","locid":"beb7587a-3acb-45a3-8661-b1f5c2ed408c","name":"Fritsch, Jonas","orcid":"0000-0001-9065-2843","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788778303165"],"pages":"426-429","publisher":"the royal danish academy of fine arts, schools architecture, design and conservation","publisher_org":"The Royal Danish Academy of Fine Arts, Schools Architecture, Design and Conservation","status":"p","subtitle":"online proceedings","title":"Nordes 2013 : Exper