{"abstract":"This article addresses how the notion of the echo has worked as a design fiction concept in the crafting of the interactive installation, Ekkomaten. Ekkomaten is an affectively engaging listening machine that lets people probe the narrative potential of Store Torv, in Aarhus, Denmark. Through its physical manifestation and conceptual framing, Ekkomaten offers an auditory and situated experience of the 18th century through six site-specific echoes that engage its users as protagonists in the exploration of an imagined narrative space emerging from the intersection of fact and fiction and the infra- and extraordinary. As an electronic design object, Ekkomaten points both back and forward in time, questioning our current understanding of the 18th century, science fiction's previous visions of the future, and current ideas about possible post-digital futures.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Fritsch, Jonas","Breinbjerg, Morten","Basballe, Ditte Amund"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-017534"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Affective engagement","Digital Aesthetics","Experience Design","Infra ordinary","Interaction design","auditory interface","design ﬁction"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ekkomaten exploring the echo as a design fiction concept","src":["au","itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/14626268.2013.771673","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-017534","identifier":[{"id":"84878637300","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-42bbea7b-00f7-4a47-95c0-f3befc5c473c","itu-638f7195-36c8-40f6-9802-4aee0aa99503"],"keyword":["affective engagement","auditory interface","design ﬁction","digital aesthetics","experience design","infra-ordinary","interaction design"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-A818E935CA396EF08914C07DDDD06201"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/14626268.2013.771673","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Humanities (HUM)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, School of Communication and Culture, School of Communication and Culture - Information Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jonas","key":"fritschpau","last":"Fritsch","locid":"beb7587a-3acb-45a3-8661-b1f5c2ed408c","name":"Fritsch, Jonas","orcid":"0000-0001-9065-2843","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Morten","key":"breinbjergpau","last":"Breinbjerg","locid":"b02f3aab-f1ab-4748-bb16-255759b46b0d","name":"Breinbjerg, Morten","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ditte Amund","key":"basballepau","last":"Basballe","locid":"7739ad7a-05e3-461e-b2bc-34c51db8a0a5","name":"Basballe, Ditte Amund","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1080/14626268.2013.771673","issn":["14626268","17443806"],"issn_org":["14626268"],"issue":"1","journal":"Digital Creativity","pages":"60-74","publisher":"Taylor and Francis Ltd.","status":"p","title":"Digital Creativity","volume":"24"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84878637300"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-42bbea7b-00f7-4a47-95c0-f3befc5c473c","itu-638f7195-36c8-40f6-9802-4aee0aa99503"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Ekkomaten : - Exploring the Echo as a Design Fiction Concept","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-017534","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"Hvad Installationen består af: en skærm, en computer, en bonprinter og 3 bøger. I hver af bøgerne er der indbygget sensorer, der kan registrere tryk. Ved at trykke på bøgerne, kan man skabe et digt, som automatisk printes ud på en bonprinter, og som man kan tage med sig. Hvordan Når installationen er i stilstand, vises et ordhav. Når man løfter en af bøgerne, kommer et hvidt tekstfelt til syne midt i ordhavet. Dernæst kommer der en tekstlinje frem. Ved at trykke på bogen kan man ændre på teksten. Der er yderligere to grader af teksten ud over den, som først optræder. Ved at fastholde trykket, vælger man den grad, man gerne vil have. Så ryger tekstlinjen ind på plads på det hvide tekstfelt og en ny fremkommer. Man fortsætter sådan, indtil digtet er færdigt. Dernæst printes det automatisk ud på en bonprinter og man kan tage det med sig. Bemærk: Der er forskellige tekster tilknyttet hver bog. Ved at bruge forskellige bøger, kan man altså skabe forskellige tekster. Man må gerne bruge flere bøger på én gang. Hvorfor Formålet med værket er at vise ét af de træk, der ofte gør sig gældende i digital litteratur; nemlig at brugeren skal gøre noget med værket for at få det til at give mening. Her skal man selv være aktiv, for at der bliver skabt et digt. Det er først gennem brugerens interaktion med værket, at man egentlig kan tale om, at der er et værk. Værkets lydbillede har – ud over at det er en del af værket – til formål både at skabe et lydligt rum for installationen, og at gøre det tydeligt, hvem der interagerer med hvilken tekst i værket, når der er flere, der leger med det samtidigt.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Pold, Søren Bro","Fritsch, Jonas","Vestergaard, Lasse Steenbock"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-022987"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"tilfældigvis er skærmen blevet blæk","src":["au","itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dnt","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://blaek.netlitteratur.dk/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-022987","ids":["au-8db94784-8b0f-4e87-8af0-aa76bcede50d","itu-a87cd109-4468-4747-8f16-b521dedd888a"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-2-E2AB09E2F1E72F62B7D0E465688839F9"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://blaek.netlitteratur.dk/","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, School of Communication and Culture, School of Communication and Culture - Information Science","Aarhus University, Arts, School of Communication and Culture, School of Communication and Culture - Participatory Information Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Design"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Bro","key":"poldpau","last":"Pold","locid":"4db7e12a-61c5-4e14-9259-5a071cb224eb","name":"Pold, Søren Bro","orcid":"0000-0002-8924-2772","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jonas","key":"fritschpau","last":"Fritsch","locid":"beb7587a-3acb-45a3-8661-b1f5c2ed408c","name":"Fritsch, Jonas","orcid":"0000-0001-9065-2843","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lasse Steenbock","key":"vestergaardpau","last":"Vestergaard","locid":"439c66ca-fdd2-4f15-8470-2fbbcdccc53f","name":"Vestergaard, Lasse Steenbock","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-8db94784-8b0f-4e87-8af0-aa76bcede50d","itu-a87cd109-4468-4747-8f16-b521dedd888a"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Tilfældigvis er skærmen blevet blæk","type":"Non-Textual Item","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-022987","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"I dette kapitel viser vi, hvordan man kan forstå byen som et rum for en række oplevelser, der aktivt bruger digitale teknologier. Vi betragter disse rum som teknologibårne oplevelsesrum, der bryder ind i vores hverdagsrutiner og ændrer de steder vi færdes. Det teknologibårne oplevelsesrum opstår i samspillet mellem stedet for interaktionen, det interagerende menneske og den digitale teknologi. I kapitlet beskrives, hvordan en række af projekterne i Digital Urban Living kan forståes som en speciel genre af designede oplevelsesrum, hvor digitale teknologier er blevet brugt til at give nyt liv og skabe nye urbane interaktioner i og omkring Aarhus i forskellige offentlige rum. Vi diskuterer på baggrund heraf, hvordan nye interaktive teknologier vil påvirke de teknologibårne oplevelsesrum, der bliver en del af vores liv i fremtidens byer.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Basballe, Ditte Amund","Fritsch, Jonas"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-029794"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"digitale og interaktive teknologier som oplevelse","src":["au","itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S02-100.00-029794","ids":["au-ec2d09db-a983-4ca7-8cd0-d11e819ccfa2","itu-839c27b4-ef5b-4a64-8ce0-902b5bffd268"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-2-A3D20183D961458AE7D1FB88F745F643"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus University, Faculty of Humanit